    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuprofwetu wakutena Ejipitu. Tiyenu, Yehova hakwendela hevu dasweja lufuchi, hakushika kuEjipitu, nkishi jakuEjipitu chikumumona jikuzaala, ninyichima yawaEjipitu yikunowa mumavumu awu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AEjipitu nukuyisaŋu mwina akwawu aEjipitu; akalwaŋana, iwu nakulwa namana kwindi, iwu nakulwa nantuŋinindi, mukala namukala, wanta nawanta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Spiritu yaEjipitu yakamwaŋaka mukachi kawu, nakakisaŋana mpùŋa yawu; akakeŋakeŋa kunkishi nikudi atudyaŋu, nikudi akwakuzakuka akishi, nikudi atutepa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AEjipitu nakayisha muchikasa chakalamba wukweti wukatu; akayiyulaŋa kudi mwantawazuwa. Dimu mwanahoshiyi Mwanta Yehova wamazaza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukaluŋalwiji mwakamana meji, kaloŋa kakanoŋa, kakoma chau.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atulamba amuZowani asupa chikupu; mpùŋa yawantu aswejamaana, ashakamaŋa naFwaro hampùŋa, yinabalumuki yawunyama; mudi nakumwila Fwaro ŋahi, nenu, Ami ni mwana kawakwamaana, nimwana kawanyanta akushankulu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu antu eyi akwamaana hiyadihi? Akuleji dinu, eluki mwanafu ukwiluwu aEjipitu kudi Yehova wamazaza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu aEjipitu akekala neyi ambanda; akazaala, akati yawoma nanochu chakazwiyayi Yehova wamazaza chikasa chindi, chakuzwiyayihewulu dawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ituŋa dawaYuda dakafwisha aEjipitu mutentu, antu ejima akatenenawu itupidi akatiya woma, nakufuukula kwaYehova wamazaza kwadi nakuyifuukwilayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu mwituŋa daEjipitu mwakekala nyikala yamaneniyitanu yahoshaŋa idimi damuKenani, yasanyikaŋa Yehova wamazaza; wumu akawutena nawu, Mukala wakujilumuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu mukachi ketupa daEjipitu mwakekala kameŋa akaYehova, nikupinza yadu kwakekala kaposhi kaYehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hichinjikijilu niwunsahu wakushimuna nachu Yehova wamazaza mwituŋa daEjipitu; muloŋa akadilila kudi Yehova nansaŋu jawa kwakuyi kabisha, wakayi temeshela chamwinu, nikakiŋa kamayanda, wakayipulwisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova akamwiluka kudi aEjipitu, aEjipitu akamwiluka Yehova dena ifuku odu; mwalala akamujilokela nikuketula yimuna, nikulambula nyilambu, akadishiila mukudi Yehova, nikuchikoŋa akachikoŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova waketa aEjipitu, nikweta nikuuka; akafunta cheŋa kudi Yehova; wena akamule mbelela, wakayuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu kwakekala mukwakwa wakufuma muEjipitu wakuya kuAshuri, niaAshuri akenza muEjipitu, aEjipitu nawa akaya muAshuri; aEjipitu akajilokelaŋa hamu nawaAshuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dena ifuku odu aIsarela akekala amuchisatu nawaEjipitu nawaAshuri, akekala nkisu hakachi keseki; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nanochu chakuyikiswilayi Yehova wamazazankisu, nindi, Kisu kisu, enu antu ami aEjipitu, ninenu aAshuri mudi muwaku makasami, ninenu aIsarela wuswana wami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.19.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
